WEBVTT

00:02.020 --> 00:06.610
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

01:30.400 --> 01:34.860
<b>Naughty Show Down</b>

01:37.660 --> 01:42.000
Charlotte, would you like coffee or tea?

01:42.950 --> 01:45.250
I'll take whatever you're having.

01:49.230 --> 01:52.760
I'm having this super special, 
nasty, nutritious potion.

01:52.760 --> 01:55.300
Are you <i>sure</i> you want the same?

01:55.300 --> 01:56.250
I'll have tea!

01:58.260 --> 02:00.810
Didn't I tell you to be honest?

02:00.810 --> 02:03.080
It's just choosing a beverage.

02:03.080 --> 02:04.260
It's not a big deal.

02:04.530 --> 02:08.260
But you couldn't even do 
that before, could you?

02:10.560 --> 02:13.860
It is true that my running away 
from the house was the first time

02:13.860 --> 02:17.020
I decided to do something on 
my own since they took me in.

02:17.300 --> 02:19.320
The first was running away, 
and this is the second one?

02:19.320 --> 02:21.530
What a series of important choices.

02:21.770 --> 02:23.160
You think so?

02:23.160 --> 02:24.010
Yes.

02:24.010 --> 02:27.630
If there are other things you 
want to try, let me know.

02:27.630 --> 02:30.040
Things I want to try?

02:39.600 --> 02:41.300
I found you!

02:42.560 --> 02:45.330
I'd like to ask for future reference.

02:45.330 --> 02:46.550
How did you find me?

02:46.550 --> 02:47.930
Easy.

02:47.930 --> 02:51.050
I narrowed my search to this
region from the pollen on your letter.

02:51.150 --> 02:52.550
That way

02:51.480 --> 02:56.080
And I asked people one by one if 
they knew a strange sorcerer.

02:52.420 --> 02:54.090
That way.

02:53.060 --> 02:54.550
That way

02:55.070 --> 02:56.060
That way

02:57.540 --> 03:00.070
I see that your unwanted 
initiative remains unchanged.

03:00.440 --> 03:03.340
Allen, who is this?

03:04.510 --> 03:07.250
That's my line, you know?

03:07.250 --> 03:08.080
But whatever.

03:09.020 --> 03:12.720
I'm Eruca Crawford, an 
apprentice sorcery engineer.

03:12.720 --> 03:14.090
I'm his little sister!

03:14.090 --> 03:15.740
Your sister?

03:15.740 --> 03:17.160
Step-sister, to be exact.

03:17.160 --> 03:18.440
Step-sister?

03:22.280 --> 03:27.280
I lost my parents when I was young, 
and the Crawfords took me in.

03:27.280 --> 03:29.090
Eruca is their daughter.

03:29.090 --> 03:33.290
I-I'm sorry, I didn't mean to 
pry into your family situation...

03:33.610 --> 03:35.430
I don't mind.

03:35.430 --> 03:38.110
By the way, you and Eruca are the same age.

03:38.470 --> 03:40.660
Excuse me, but I mind!

03:40.660 --> 03:42.180
Who's this?

03:42.180 --> 03:43.930
Is it your girlfriend?

03:43.930 --> 03:45.430
Girl... No...!

03:46.350 --> 03:47.610
She's not!

03:46.350 --> 03:47.610
I'm not!

03:48.050 --> 03:49.610
In unison...

03:50.780 --> 03:52.640
Listen, Eruca.

03:52.640 --> 03:55.830
I'm sure it'll make Charlotte 
sick to her stomach

03:55.830 --> 03:59.330
to be mistaken as the girlfriend of 
a social misfit with character flaws

03:59.330 --> 04:01.870
who's also a dour, genius sorcerer.

04:02.400 --> 04:06.130
For her honor's sake, I am 
going to firmly deny that.

04:06.130 --> 04:09.140
I-I would never think that!

04:09.430 --> 04:11.880
Doesn't it make you sad saying that?

04:12.330 --> 04:13.790
It's the truth.

04:13.790 --> 04:15.800
That's nothing to be proud of.

04:15.800 --> 04:18.660
So, who is she if she's not your girlfriend?

04:20.040 --> 04:21.910
I-I'm...

04:22.300 --> 04:24.590
This is Charlotte Evans.

04:24.590 --> 04:26.910
A criminal who's run away 
from the neighboring nation.

04:27.250 --> 04:29.410
Wait, Allen...

04:29.940 --> 04:31.730
It's pointless to hide.

04:31.730 --> 04:35.010
She's going to find out sooner or later.

04:35.010 --> 04:37.420
It's better to be honest and tell her.

04:38.590 --> 04:40.920
If you say so, Allen...

04:41.290 --> 04:44.670
Well then, let's begin with 
how Charlotte and I met...

04:46.530 --> 04:50.690
So, in short, you're hiding this girl 
who's been exiled from her country

04:50.690 --> 04:54.040
for a crime she didn't commit and 
teaching her naughty things...

04:55.150 --> 04:58.680
I've always thought you were 
an idiot, but I was wrong.

04:59.160 --> 05:00.690
You're a <i>huge</i> idiot!

05:00.950 --> 05:02.710
I see. Why?

05:02.990 --> 05:05.380
Isn't that obvious?

05:05.380 --> 05:09.710
Instead of feeding her 
and making her hit you,

05:09.710 --> 05:14.490
teach her naughty things that girls actually enjoy!

05:14.490 --> 05:16.710
<i>That's</i> your takeaway?!

05:18.360 --> 05:20.730
It must have been so hard!

05:20.730 --> 05:24.210
If there's anything I can 
do, feel free to tell me!

05:25.610 --> 05:27.210
U-Um...

05:27.210 --> 05:28.820
Are you sure?

05:28.820 --> 05:32.450
It's weird coming from me, but 
I'm suspicious, aren't I?

05:32.450 --> 05:34.210
But my brother believes you, right?

05:34.570 --> 05:36.520
Then you're good!

05:36.520 --> 05:42.220
My bro may not be much, but he can 
sniff out bad guys like a dog!

05:44.490 --> 05:46.970
So, what is your actual 
purpose for coming here?

05:47.410 --> 05:51.740
I came here to bring you home, 
but that doesn't matter now!

05:52.090 --> 05:54.550
I'll take care of Charlotte too!

05:54.550 --> 05:56.740
I can teach her all kinds 
of naughty things...

05:57.190 --> 05:59.880
You, teaching Charlotte?

05:59.880 --> 06:01.240
Don't make me laugh.

06:01.760 --> 06:03.240
What do you mean?

06:03.990 --> 06:08.040
<i>I</i> can teach her naughty 
things better than anyone!

06:08.040 --> 06:09.760
You are not needed.

06:10.760 --> 06:14.760
There are women's pleasures that can 
only be taught by another woman!

06:14.760 --> 06:16.230
Don't be ridiculous!

06:16.230 --> 06:19.800
I think about naughty things day and night.

06:19.800 --> 06:21.900
You wouldn't even come close!

06:21.900 --> 06:23.120
What?!

06:23.120 --> 06:26.530
I can make her weak in the 
knees with my techniques!

06:26.930 --> 06:29.520
Arguing here isn't going to get us anywhere.

06:29.760 --> 06:34.780
You want to compete and see who can 
teach more naughty things to Charlotte?

06:34.780 --> 06:38.300
What kind of competition is that?!

06:38.300 --> 06:39.520
You're on!

