My hair... has turned dark.

07:00.670 --> 07:02.840
It's simple disguise magic.

07:02.840 --> 07:06.330
If we change your hair, no 
one will know it's you.

07:07.640 --> 07:09.660
Leave the styling to me!

07:10.710 --> 07:13.750
Yes, the spell is perfect.

07:15.230 --> 07:18.070
But we have to remove it 
as soon as we get home.

07:18.390 --> 07:19.520
Why?

07:19.520 --> 07:21.080
Dark hair suits her!

07:21.490 --> 07:25.640
Dark hair isn't bad, but blonde 
suits Charlotte the best.

07:25.640 --> 07:27.830
I like it much better!

07:30.830 --> 07:33.130
Hm? Did I say something strange?

07:33.610 --> 07:35.630
N-No, it's nothing.

07:35.630 --> 07:38.330
Jeez Bro, are you trying to 
score some points already?

07:39.450 --> 07:40.850
What points?

07:40.850 --> 07:43.390
If you don't get it, then never mind...

07:43.390 --> 07:45.350
Okay, her hair is done!

07:52.290 --> 07:54.660
I can't let Bro take the lead.

07:54.660 --> 07:56.200
Let's go, Charlotte!

07:59.240 --> 08:01.370
What are you going to do?

08:01.720 --> 08:03.830
Isn't it obvious?

08:03.830 --> 08:05.380
It's a naughty showdown...

08:05.380 --> 08:09.380
I'll teach her how to dress up! All girls love that!

08:18.380 --> 08:19.200
Here!

08:19.200 --> 08:21.600
This one suits you too, Charlotte!

08:21.600 --> 08:22.890
Oh, um...

08:23.330 --> 08:25.500
<i>I feel </i>so<i> out of place!</i>

08:25.500 --> 08:28.960
<i>But I can't leave in the 
middle of the competition!</i>

08:30.500 --> 08:31.740
<i>Competition.</i>

08:32.690 --> 08:33.990
<i>That's nostalgic.</i>

08:33.990 --> 08:36.600
<i>Back when the Crawfords took me in...</i>

08:38.490 --> 08:39.670
It's a competition!

08:46.410 --> 08:47.680
Checkmate.

08:48.290 --> 08:53.560
<i>She'd challenge me and lose 
thoroughly, but she never gave up.</i>

08:53.910 --> 08:56.130
I won't lose this time!

08:57.420 --> 09:01.750
<i>Was it perhaps her strange way 
of trying to get close to me?</i>

09:01.750 --> 09:03.190
Hey, Bro!

09:04.700 --> 09:05.800
Check this out.

09:08.250 --> 09:11.490
I'm a little... embarrassed...

09:11.490 --> 09:13.530
You look <i>amazing</i> in it!

09:16.360 --> 09:18.800
Hey, what do you think?

09:18.800 --> 09:22.950
<i>Compared to the dress she was wearing
 when I found her, this looks much better.</i>

09:23.320 --> 09:24.370
However...

09:24.370 --> 09:26.950
Isn't it a little... too short?

09:26.950 --> 09:29.210
Huh?! This is normal.

09:29.210 --> 09:30.590
But still...

09:31.270 --> 09:34.970
<i>This must be her first time 
putting on such a short skirt.</i>

09:35.730 --> 09:40.980
<i>Perhaps due to her well-balanced 
diet, she looks healthier than before.</i>

09:42.960 --> 09:45.930
<i>And her skin's smooth...</i>

09:51.760 --> 09:53.190
Allen?!

09:53.860 --> 09:55.590
I'm fine.

09:56.030 --> 10:00.620
I needed to calm down my heart, 
so I stopped it for a little bit.

10:00.620 --> 10:03.440
Should you be stopping that so casually?!

10:03.440 --> 10:05.810
Bro, you push yourself too much.

10:06.200 --> 10:08.130
Come on, Charlotte. Next, next!

10:18.130 --> 10:20.700
So, what do you want me to do?

10:20.700 --> 10:23.020
I want to know the current 
state of the Neruz Kingdom.

10:23.020 --> 10:25.880
Especially how Charlotte is regarded.

10:25.880 --> 10:27.330
Leave it to me.

10:27.330 --> 10:32.210
I'm sure Dad's got some friends inside 
the Neruz Kingdom, so I'll poke around.

10:32.840 --> 10:36.650
You want me to look into that 
prince and his house too?

10:36.650 --> 10:38.890
That can wait for now.

10:39.650 --> 10:40.820
Oh?

10:40.820 --> 10:42.160
You're gonna let them walk?

10:42.160 --> 10:44.720
I'd be lying if I said 
it didn't interest me.

10:44.720 --> 10:47.920
What kind of person framed Charlotte?

10:47.920 --> 10:50.700
How was she treated at the Duke's residence?

10:51.170 --> 10:53.900
Once I know, I won't be able to stay quiet.

10:54.420 --> 10:58.570
I'd storm into that country, regardless 
of how Charlotte might take it.

10:58.570 --> 11:00.500
So for the moment, let them be.

11:00.500 --> 11:01.850
I see...

11:01.850 --> 11:03.180
What's that face for?

11:03.180 --> 11:05.570
Oh, I'm just thinking how you've changed.

11:06.580 --> 11:10.310
You've never concerned 
yourself with others before.

11:10.310 --> 11:11.550
It's a good thing.

11:11.550 --> 11:13.380
It is?

11:13.380 --> 11:14.190
Um...

11:14.580 --> 11:15.590
What's up?

11:15.590 --> 11:16.990
Excuse me.

11:16.990 --> 11:20.190
I'm not able to fasten the clasp in the back...

11:20.470 --> 11:23.080
Oh, sure! I can do that.

11:24.310 --> 11:26.260
It's right here...

11:26.260 --> 11:28.480
Okay, can you turn around?

11:31.090 --> 11:33.030
Is something the matter?

11:33.030 --> 11:36.960
Right, this one is... really 
difficult to fasten...

11:38.170 --> 11:39.400
All set!

11:39.400 --> 11:40.970
This one is super cute too.

11:46.360 --> 11:48.960
Isn't this one too revealing?

11:48.960 --> 11:51.290
You're such a prude, Bro.

11:51.290 --> 11:54.530
Girls need to be aggressive, 
or they can't win.

11:54.530 --> 11:57.480
What exactly are the ladies 
in this world fighting?!

11:57.480 --> 11:58.790
Whatever.

11:58.790 --> 11:59.820
Take a look!

12:00.300 --> 12:05.090
This outfit has a huge opening 
in the back, you see?

12:05.090 --> 12:06.990
Wait, I'm not mentally prepared...

12:12.380 --> 12:15.370
Bro, take a good look.

12:15.910 --> 12:18.380
Allen, is something wrong?

12:19.040 --> 12:20.930
Oh, it's nothing.

12:20.930 --> 12:24.390
I wish it was less revealing, 
but it looks good on you.

12:24.790 --> 12:26.390
You think so?

12:26.890 --> 12:28.890
Yes, be confident.

12:29.900 --> 12:32.130
<i>Judging from the scars, 
they must be from a whip.</i>

12:32.130 --> 12:34.680
<i>It wasn't strong enough to 
break the skin or bones,</i>

12:34.680 --> 12:36.890
<i>so it was a kind of torture 
to cause pain and fear...</i>

12:37.590 --> 12:40.400
<i>Pain from whipping is 
usually gone the next day.</i>

12:40.400 --> 12:42.910
<i>Only the scars remain, like a curse.</i>

12:42.910 --> 12:45.590
<i>And she's not even aware 
of the scars herself.</i>

12:56.420 --> 12:58.210
It feels warm.

12:58.210 --> 13:01.730
I found a worn spot in the shirt, so I fixed it.

13:01.730 --> 13:03.050
Thank you very much.

13:03.470 --> 13:06.040
<i>Her scars cleared up with simple magic.</i>

13:06.510 --> 13:11.050
<i>Which means that Charlotte never 
received proper treatment.</i>

13:11.460 --> 13:14.910
<i>I can see how they could have 
ostracized her for her lineage.</i>

13:14.910 --> 13:19.800
<i>But I felt something much more 
sinister from her scars.</i>

13:19.800 --> 13:24.150
<i>What could possibly justify directing 
such hate towards Charlotte?!</i>

13:24.930 --> 13:26.340
Hey, Eruca.

13:26.340 --> 13:27.320
Yeah?

13:27.550 --> 13:29.490
Going back to our earlier conversation,

13:29.490 --> 13:32.210
I think we need to thoroughly 
terminate them.

13:32.650 --> 13:33.850
I need your help.

13:35.230 --> 13:37.690
Oh, just leave them to me!

13:37.690 --> 13:40.100
Terminate what?

13:40.100 --> 13:43.130
There's an infestation of book 
mites at our parents' home.

13:43.130 --> 13:45.850
So I've asked Eruca to air 
the books under the sun.

13:45.850 --> 13:47.600
Mites?

13:47.600 --> 13:49.220
I don't really like bugs...

13:49.220 --> 13:50.690
What a coincidence.

13:50.690 --> 13:53.470
I also <i>hate</i> bugs. They make me want to hurl!

13:53.470 --> 13:55.500
That's enough of that.

13:55.500 --> 13:57.170
It's your turn next, Bro.

13:57.170 --> 13:58.990
Pick out an outfit for Charlotte.

13:59.300 --> 14:00.620
Me?!

14:00.620 --> 14:03.020
What, you're throwing in the towel?

14:03.020 --> 14:04.540
Of course not!

14:05.290 --> 14:08.220
But we don't have to do this here...

14:08.650 --> 14:10.630
Agh, I've got no choice.

14:13.170 --> 14:14.450
I can't choose!

14:15.110 --> 14:17.500
Fine, let's go with this!

14:20.940 --> 14:22.520
Hm? What's wrong?

14:27.370 --> 14:28.320
Wha...!

14:29.010 --> 14:31.150
Bro, you're too bold...

14:31.510 --> 14:34.830
Th-This isn't what you think!

14:36.980 --> 14:39.980
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

14:39.980 --> 14:42.980
<b>I'm Giving the Disgraced Noble Lady I
Rescued a Crash Course in Naughtiness</b>

14:46.410 --> 14:48.940
What are you going to do?

14:48.940 --> 14:51.730
The naughty thing I'll 
teach her is splurging!

14:52.070 --> 14:56.110
I'll teach her the pleasure 
of releasing stress by buying

14:56.110 --> 14:59.240
a bunch of stuff she wants 
without any restrictions!

14:59.540 --> 15:02.000
P-Please go easy on me...

15:02.370 --> 15:04.150
This should be good.

15:04.150 --> 15:06.910
Charlotte, is there anything 
that piques your interest?

15:06.910 --> 15:08.770
Easy for you to say...

15:09.080 --> 15:10.290
Don't be shy.

15:10.770 --> 15:12.180
How about this?

15:12.180 --> 15:13.260
It's cute.

15:13.670 --> 15:15.010
Gross.

15:15.010 --> 15:16.170
What?!

15:16.470 --> 15:18.510
Then what about this?

15:19.500 --> 15:20.760
Lame.

15:21.110 --> 15:23.760
Grrr... Then...

15:25.610 --> 15:26.650
This one!

15:27.140 --> 15:29.310
This is <i>definitely</i> cute!

15:29.310 --> 15:30.160
Ugly!

15:30.380 --> 15:32.150
Wha... What...!

15:32.150 --> 15:34.600
Bro, honestly, you've got zero taste.

15:35.170 --> 15:36.680
What did you say...?

15:38.450 --> 15:41.420
Cut it out with that magic and 
just pull yourself together.

15:44.870 --> 15:47.170
Well, we bought a lot!

15:47.610 --> 15:49.390
What's the matter, Charlotte?

15:49.390 --> 15:50.920
You wanted to buy some more?

15:50.920 --> 15:52.590
Just the opposite!

15:52.590 --> 15:55.500
To buy so many things just for me...

15:55.500 --> 15:57.670
You mustn't waste money!

15:58.070 --> 16:02.410
This is a necessary expense to 
teach you naughty things.

16:02.410 --> 16:04.570
And everything looked great on you.

16:13.230 --> 16:14.340
What's wrong?

16:16.270 --> 16:18.690
You have no clue, do you?

16:19.800 --> 16:22.320
But you seriously have no taste.

16:22.900 --> 16:23.820
Huh?

16:24.130 --> 16:25.570
That's the truth.

16:25.570 --> 16:30.480
Everything you chose was so lame, 
 I picked out most of what we bought.

16:30.930 --> 16:35.100
If you don't understand my 
taste, you're still a child.

16:35.480 --> 16:36.850
You're a poor loser.

16:36.850 --> 16:38.100
Say what?!

16:38.450 --> 16:39.460
You wanna go?!

16:39.850 --> 16:42.080
Y-You shouldn't fight!

16:42.080 --> 16:44.610
As siblings, you should try to get along.

16:44.970 --> 16:46.570
Oh, sorry.

16:46.570 --> 16:49.150
But I wouldn't call this a fight.

16:49.150 --> 16:51.500
Yeah, this is business as usual.

16:52.490 --> 16:56.520
But fighting isn't naughty, it's bad.

16:56.910 --> 16:58.130
Understood?

16:59.040 --> 17:01.870
Okay, I'll promise that we won't fight.

17:02.390 --> 17:07.060
<i>I talked big to Eruca earlier, but 
am I not at a disadvantage here?</i>

17:06.420 --> 17:08.750
Overwhelming

17:06.420 --> 17:08.750
Overwhelming

17:06.420 --> 17:08.750
Overwhelming

17:06.420 --> 17:08.750
Overwhelming

