<i>However, as Charlotte's guardian, I can't lose!</i>

17:12.800 --> 17:13.840
Let's go!

17:14.240 --> 17:14.880
Where to?

17:15.320 --> 17:17.380
The shopping continues.

17:29.660 --> 17:32.140
Your magical wheelchair is really cool!

17:32.140 --> 17:34.650
Ah, it's powered by wind magic!

17:34.650 --> 17:37.390
There goes the magical equipment geek.

17:37.390 --> 17:39.320
Let's leave her here.

17:39.320 --> 17:41.090
What? Are you sure?

17:42.140 --> 17:43.910
Which shop made this?

17:44.300 --> 17:45.920
I made it.

17:46.300 --> 17:48.400
For real?! Amazing!

17:49.300 --> 17:51.410
Hello, welcome.

17:53.720 --> 17:56.420
Allen, are you looking for jewelry?

17:56.800 --> 17:59.010
There's something that grabbed my attention.

18:00.100 --> 18:00.940
Yes.

18:02.430 --> 18:05.590
It's the same color as your eyes.

18:06.150 --> 18:08.470
May I please have this?

18:08.470 --> 18:09.370
Sure thing.

18:09.370 --> 18:10.440
That'd be one silver coin.

18:10.440 --> 18:11.370
Keep the change.

18:11.370 --> 18:12.930
Thank you for your business.

18:12.930 --> 18:14.590
Wha... wait, sir!

18:14.590 --> 18:16.150
This is a gold coin!

18:16.150 --> 18:17.940
No matter how you look at
it, this is far too much...

18:18.380 --> 18:19.640
Please keep it.

18:20.230 --> 18:23.700
It's my policy to pay an appropriate 
amount for a job well done.

18:25.940 --> 18:27.430
I'd like you to have it.

18:27.430 --> 18:29.720
It's not much, though.

18:31.660 --> 18:35.610
Oh, this is my favorite!

18:37.070 --> 18:41.440
<i>My heart feels strange, even though I 
haven't put a death curse on myself...</i>

18:43.640 --> 18:44.600
Whoa there.

18:44.970 --> 18:46.100
Charlotte!

18:47.360 --> 18:49.630
The hell? That hurt.

18:49.630 --> 18:51.470
Watch where you're going.

18:51.470 --> 18:54.110
Hey, do you know who we are?

18:54.110 --> 18:55.730
We're from the Gankutsu group.

18:55.730 --> 18:57.180
I don't know what that is.

18:57.590 --> 19:01.240
But it would be helpful if we 
can resolve this peacefully.

19:01.590 --> 19:03.550
Hey, you think you can take 
that attitude with us?!

19:03.550 --> 19:05.220
He's screwing with us.

19:05.220 --> 19:06.260
Let's take him down!

19:06.260 --> 19:09.990
<i>They dare blame Charlotte for their 
own failure to pay attention?</i>

19:09.990 --> 19:13.010
<i>I think I may need to teach 
them a lesson here...</i>

19:14.000 --> 19:17.500
Fighting is not naughty, it's bad!

19:19.640 --> 19:22.410
I see that my companion 
has caused you trouble.

19:22.410 --> 19:23.510
I apologize on her behalf.

19:23.510 --> 19:25.810
Oh, I forgive you.

19:25.810 --> 19:28.010
On one condition.

19:28.290 --> 19:30.160
Thanks for your understanding.

19:30.160 --> 19:31.010
How much do you want?

19:31.310 --> 19:32.770
We don't need money.

19:32.770 --> 19:35.020
Loan that woman over 
there to us for the night.

19:35.350 --> 19:36.490
Huh?

19:37.510 --> 19:40.610
I see she's rather hot stuff.

19:40.610 --> 19:42.360
Hey, come with us.

19:42.360 --> 19:46.060
We'll buy you more expensive 
jewelry, not this cheap stuff.

19:46.060 --> 19:47.790
I-I'd rather not...

19:47.790 --> 19:49.730
Don't be shy.

19:49.730 --> 19:51.430
We'll show you paradise 
with our techniques—

19:54.600 --> 19:57.040
Go to hell, garbage bug!

19:57.400 --> 19:59.990
What did you do to my friend!

20:00.970 --> 20:03.350
That sword is magical equipment!

20:03.350 --> 20:04.920
Get outta here quick, dude!

20:13.680 --> 20:19.090
If you touch my dear Charlotte 
with those dirty hands of yours,

20:19.090 --> 20:23.350
I'll ground them to bits 
until there's nothing left!

20:24.090 --> 20:25.450
Phew, that felt good.

20:25.450 --> 20:26.920
W-Whoa...

20:26.920 --> 20:28.690
Way to go, dude!

20:32.620 --> 20:35.200
Um, thank you for your support—

20:37.580 --> 20:41.440
S-Sorry! I just promised 
you that I wouldn't fight.

20:41.440 --> 20:42.960
I scared you, didn't I...?

20:46.520 --> 20:52.060
I don't like violence, but I know 
you were trying to help me.

20:52.060 --> 20:56.490
Also... I'd never be scared of you.

20:57.390 --> 20:58.660
Is that so?

20:58.660 --> 20:59.830
That's good to hear.

21:00.650 --> 21:01.480
<i>Hmm?</i>

21:02.210 --> 21:06.860
<i>I initially thought that Charlotte would 
despise me and leave right away.</i>

21:07.300 --> 21:10.640
<i>But now, I'm relieved to know 
that she doesn't hate me...?</i>

21:11.010 --> 21:13.970
<i>Is this that change Eruca spoke of?</i>

21:15.880 --> 21:17.300
Something the matter?

21:17.300 --> 21:18.550
It's nothing.

21:18.550 --> 21:22.050
It seems that I'm finally losing my edge.

21:22.050 --> 21:25.750
I'm getting addicted to 
teaching you naughty things.

21:25.750 --> 21:27.800
Y-You are...?

21:29.460 --> 21:33.130
<i>Man, I guess I lost the 
naughty lesson competition.</i>

21:33.530 --> 21:37.310
<i>When it comes to love and romance, 
Bro has to be the one to teach her.</i>

21:50.890 --> 21:57.020
I hear my boys had a run-in with you?

23:30.520 --> 23:32.740
Let's just say you've won this competition.

23:32.740 --> 23:33.930
Tell me why.

23:33.930 --> 23:35.730
Even if I did, you wouldn't understand!

23:35.720 --> 23:39.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:35.720 --> 23:39.970
<b>Naughty Outing</b>

23:35.730 --> 23:37.360
Next episode, "Naughty Outing."

23:37.360 --> 23:39.360
You don't know squat about love and romance.
